  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_header.webp\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=c20045&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-c20045?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge projects\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-c20045?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth projects\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fnether-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"View Structures\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_overview.webp\" alt=\"Overview\"></p>\n<p>本模組支援 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也可僅安裝於伺服器端。Forge 在 1.20.4 版本後已停止支援。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>Moogs Nether Structures 為《我的世界》的下界維度增添了全新且令人興奮的結構。在探索過程中，你會發現戰利品、強大的敵人以及有趣的挑戰。本模組既可以獨立運行，也可以與我們的主結構模組 MVS 搭配使用。它能完美融入任何模組包，並保持原版遊戲的感覺。跳入下界，看看你能發現什麼吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fnether-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"Browse every structure live in 3D\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我們的主結構模組 MVS：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<h3>配置包</h3>\n<p>模組的每個方面都可以透過數據包進行自定義。包含完整說明模板可在此處找到：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mns-moogs-nether-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_features.webp\" alt=\"features\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/RH0cIuq.png\" alt=\"collage\"></p>\n<h3>影片</h3>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kVKuCqDgfsY?si=IN54-VglgPArp0d-?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wlzgAujeqFY?si=3V3KSkn-BeHOrrIY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>模組包</h3>\n<p>查看所有模組包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d55402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_discord.webp\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<p>獲得回覆的最佳且最快的方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_promo.webp\" alt=\"BHsponser\"></a></p>",
